{
  "total_ms": 71270,
  "total_chars": 298,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "半夜十一点，亲戚打来电话：孩子住院，押金还差两万——这样的钱，您借不借？",
      "chars": 36,
      "speech_ms": 8480,
      "pause_after_ms": 600,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 8480,
      "trace_id": "0747c8b347474a9160b3cb89a4880eb6"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这叫救急，人命关天的难处，搭把手是情分。",
      "chars": 20,
      "speech_ms": 4500,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 9080,
      "end_ms": 13580,
      "trace_id": "0747c8b60406d3f5d2c12567ffacaf50"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "可还有一种借：借去填窟窿、堵亏空，填进去多少都是无底洞。",
      "chars": 28,
      "speech_ms": 6300,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "start_ms": 13980,
      "end_ms": 20280,
      "trace_id": "0747c8c1c1ea0262b5842f2f3302436f"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "老话讲，救急不救穷。",
      "chars": 10,
      "speech_ms": 2450,
      "pause_after_ms": 600,
      "start_ms": 20780,
      "end_ms": 23230,
      "trace_id": "0747c8c3fcd559522b73fe7fbe9ffae3"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "先说清：这句是民间老话，不是书里的原话；书里真正写着的，是《中国式人情世故》第二章那句——人情要厚积，关系在往来。",
      "chars": 57,
      "speech_ms": 13290,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 23830,
      "end_ms": 37120,
      "trace_id": "0747c8cea6bb34795c1606048dda1005"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "再说我自己的做法：钱往外借之前，先把归还的约定说清楚，什么时候还、怎么还，当场说明白，金额大小都一样。",
      "chars": 51,
      "speech_ms": 11370,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 37520,
      "end_ms": 48890,
      "trace_id": "0747c8d18eb3fb5303b6d20006047e7d"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这钱舍不舍得当人情送了，是借之前自己拿的主意，不是借出去以后被迫算了。",
      "chars": 35,
      "speech_ms": 7160,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "start_ms": 49290,
      "end_ms": 56450,
      "trace_id": "0747c8d4cb479e07562d25b426ed05f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "约定在先，钱借得安心，交情也处得长久。",
      "chars": 19,
      "speech_ms": 4460,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "start_ms": 56950,
      "end_ms": 61410,
      "trace_id": "0747c8d8a8271ba5ef02d43be13578cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这本书我放在主页橱窗里了，点开我主页，商品橱窗里就有。",
      "chars": 27,
      "speech_ms": 5330,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 61910,
      "end_ms": 67240,
      "trace_id": "0747c8e34c609eb0ef6e9b398ccea6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "您借出去的钱，后来要回来了吗？",
      "chars": 15,
      "speech_ms": 2820,
      "pause_after_ms": 800,
      "start_ms": 67640,
      "end_ms": 70460,
      "trace_id": "0747c8e6df10d3db6cdf027180d5dc83"
    }
  ]
}